{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.06177226384480794,"t":"Test 6","h":0.014628118845262383,"y":0.072627800734596182,"x":0.10697395028313422,"c":1},{"x":0.15226336306111052,"t":"Some participating authors and commentators argued in favour of community-","y":0.11918604635199226,"w":0.74074076334635408,"h":0.017445284570484998,"c":1},{"y":0.13662790716362827,"t":"based and autonomous risk management strategies through collective action","x":0.15226339296704186,"w":0.72839502970377612,"h":0.01744185965530165,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.15274789370662101,"h":0.02048004923215041,"w":0.70182871500651045,"x":0.15216829434780532,"t":"groups, co-operatives or producers' groups. Such groups enhance market"},{"w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.15432098157988189,"t":"opportunities for small-scale producers, reduce marketing costs and synchronise","y":0.17285041236425391,"c":1},{"t":"buying and selling with seasonal price conditions. According to Murphy, 'collective","h":0.022210811978936706,"y":0.18853584300658044,"c":1,"x":0.15422032042116096,"w":0.7697702026367188},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.20784883706327428,"w":0.78806584676106772,"t":"action offers an important way for farmers to strengthen their political and economic","x":0.15432098599159152},{"t":"bargaining power, and to reduce their business risks.' One commentator, Giel Ton,","x":0.15425552415237462,"w":0.77791936238606774,"y":0.22414837976026525,"h":0.020269836497671889,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01897067596830937,"t":"warned that collective action does not come as a free good. It takes time, effort","y":0.24411071898572956,"x":0.15226336214347433,"w":0.74691360473632795},{"x":0.15432097970567943,"h":0.017667844522968323,"y":0.26148409913344306,"t":"and money to organise, build trust and to experiment. Others, like Marcel Vernooij","w":0.77366256713867188,"c":1},{"t":"and Marcel Beukeboom, suggested that in order to 'apply what we already know',","h":0.018927876323075465,"w":0.77160491943359366,"c":1,"x":0.15432099706416968,"y":0.27906976782875981},{"t":"all stakeholders, including business, government, scientists and civil society, must","h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.77366256713867188,"c":1,"x":0.15432097970365552,"y":0.29796511611998078},{"w":0.54953887939453128,"t":"work together, starting at the beginning of the value chain.","h":0.020130456266189811,"x":0.15422655071769215,"c":1,"y":0.31320517900714295},{"w":0.74691355387369796,"t":"Some participants explained that market price volatility is often worsened by the","y":0.34156976762874458,"h":0.017441859655301539,"x":0.15226339119586707,"c":1},{"w":0.79012344360351561,"h":0.018955267781503693,"c":1,"x":0.15432100083198691,"t":"presence of intermediary purchasers who, taking advantage of farmers' vulnerability,","y":0.35895170833464474},{"y":0.37669973290476966,"t":"dictate prices. One commentator suggested farmers can gain greater control over","x":0.15425575194053237,"w":0.76350886027018228,"h":0.01917650000366633,"c":1},{"x":0.15425513275861721,"t":"prices and minimise price volatility by selling directly to consumers. Similarly, Sonali","h":0.01922088910609443,"w":0.78201828002929685,"c":1,"y":0.39521203023132256},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"Bisht, founder and advisor to the Institute of Himalayan Environmental Research","y":0.41424418590053769,"w":0.74897120157877606,"x":0.15637859664214318},{"c":1,"t":"and Education (INHERE), India, wrote that community-supported agriculture, where","x":0.15426285811057491,"w":0.77996322631835924,"h":0.018603477657753942,"y":0.43071535751236456},{"w":0.75720163981119792,"t":"consumers invest in local farmers by subscription and guarantee producers a fair","x":0.15432099081000691,"h":0.017512052443900861,"c":1,"y":0.44905771514947579},{"w":0.77366256713867188,"h":0.016195524146054074,"c":1,"y":0.46790341565022198,"x":0.15432097970477826,"t":"price, is a risk-sharing model worth more attention. Direct food distribution systems"},{"x":0.15432099060736873,"y":0.48546511613074517,"c":1,"h":0.016007204359074767,"t":"not only encourage small-scale agriculture but also give consumers more control","w":0.75720163981119804},{"w":0.37469118754069008,"c":1,"h":0.018894727996718319,"y":0.50276699128075175,"t":"over the tood they consume, she wrote.","x":0.15420972095554655},{"x":0.10905349746667056,"y":0.9447674416834505,"w":0.026748971939086902,"t":"38","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.20851318359374998,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39469720757347232,"y":0.96598359674835832,"h":0.018254359844014467,"c":1}],"h":3395}